Aim

To create search advertisements using Google Ads.

Beginner Level Exact Steps
Step 1: Open Browser

Open Google Chrome.

Step 2: Open Google Ads Website

Go to:

Google Ads

Step 3: Login with Gmail
Enter Gmail ID
Enter password
Login successfully
Step 4: Create New Campaign
In dashboard click:
New Campaign
Step 5: Select Campaign Goal

Choose any goal:

Website traffic
Sales
Leads

Example:

Website Traffic
Step 6: Select Search Campaign

Choose:

Search Campaign

This type shows ads in Google search results.

Step 7: Enter Business Information

Enter:

Website URL
Campaign name

Example:

Field	Example
Website	www.fooddelivery.com

Campaign Name	Food Delivery Search Ads
Step 8: Set Campaign Budget

Enter daily budget.

Example:

₹100 per day
Step 9: Select Target Location

Choose:

Country
State
City

Example:

Tamil Nadu
Step 10: Add Keywords

Enter keywords related to business.

Example Keywords
order food online
pizza delivery
fast food near me
online food delivery
Step 11: Write Headlines
Example Headlines
Order Food Online
Fast Home Delivery
Best Food Offers
Step 12: Write Advertisement Description
Example Description
Order delicious food online with fast delivery and exciting offers.
Step 13: Preview Advertisement

Google Ads shows:

Mobile preview
Desktop preview

Check advertisement appearance.

Step 14: Publish Search Ad

Click:

Publish Campaign

Search advertisement created successfully.

Step 15: Take Screenshots

Take screenshots of:

Campaign setup
Keywords
Headlines
Ad preview

(Useful for practical record)
